":"广汉太守，进从横计于弘，被斩","evidence":["liusima-q-8b45d584a2992e492ff1"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liusima-e-o181","title":"刘弘有保全江汉之志，不附太傅司马越，会弘病卒","time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-76ffd1a30b45aa121968"]},"order":3246,"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0005","role":"于时天下虽乱、荆州安全，有刘景升保有江、汉之志，不附太傅司马越","evidence":["liusima-q-76ffd1a30b45aa121968"]},{"person":"liusima-p0013","role":"太傅，甚衔之","evidence":["liusima-q-76ffd1a30b45aa121968"]}],"accounts":[]}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0005","name":"刘弘（刘靖子）","evidence":["liusima-q-2b9c9725e35c15d665b6","liusima-q-f1e9998e0d775fb148b8","liusima-q-84906577404b280be13f","liusima-q-746f7923c660b3411184","liusima-q-8b45d584a2992e492ff1","liusima-q-76ffd1a30b45aa121968","liusima-q2-43495d28ff83bbd096c5","liusima-q2-71240b398921a557f42d"],"facts":[{"id":"liusima-f2-35616cbad3dfdc446dd4","text":"《晋阳秋》记其为车骑将军、开府、荆州刺史，假节，都督荆、交、广州诸军事，封宣城公。","evidence":["liusima-q2-43495d28ff83bbd096c5"]},{"id":"liusima-f2-e000526d9ed16169adb7","text":"《晋诸公赞》记其子璠为北中郎将。","evidence":["liusima-q2-71240b398921a557f42d"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
